This is a test file for the QoS best-effort to TCP fallback regression test.
The bundle containing this file is sent with BP_BEST_EFFORT QoS flag.
It should be forwarded via LTP (green) from Node 1 to Node 2.
At Node 2, it should fall back to TCP (reliable) to reach Node 3.
Without the fix, this bundle would be stuck in limbo at Node 2.
With the fix, it arrives successfully at Node 3.
